# Pull request review (Dose)

Default: local analysis only. Do not comment, approve, or request changes on GitHub unless the user asks to publish.

1. `gh pr view <n> --json title,body,baseRefName,headRefName,files,commits`
2. `gh pr diff <n>`
3. `gh pr checks <n>` if available

Deliver: Summary, Strengths, Issues (blocker / suggestion / nit), Test plan gaps, Verdict (advisory).
